The demand of legal facilities  are as follows:-
 1) To pay 20% increment on gross salary to the workmen  who have completed 21 years of service;
 2) To pay the increment @ 15% p.a. on gross salary to  the workmen, who have completed 11 to 20 years of  service;
 3) To pay increment @ 10% p.a. on gross salary to the  workmen who have completed 1 to 10 years service with  the management;
 4) To pay House Rent Allowance @ 30% p.m. on gross  salary to the workmen;
