 11) To provide improved uniform and shoes to all the  workmen;
 12) To increase accumulation of earned leave from 150  days to 180 days;
 13) To provide facility of LTC: Every permanent  employee be given a sum of Rs. 5,000/- after 2 years as  LTC for himself and family;
 14) To pay the service charges @ 10% from the member  of the club on each trip in the club, and the amount be  distributed equally among the workmen;
 15) To regularize the workmen who have completed 240  days service in a year without any interval or  uninterrupted as permanent;
 16) To pay loan amount of Rs. 50,000/- to all the  workmen at the time of marriage of their daughter and  son, which may be deducted in installment from the  salary of the staff concerned;
