3. Written statement filed by the management wherein objections have been taken:
 (a) The statement of claim filed by the workmen is not  maintainable as the same has been filed without any  cause of action;
 (b) Claim is not maintainable as the same has been  filed with the abuse of the process of law in order to  extract money from the management for which  workmen are not entitled;
 (c) Claim is not maintainable as it is not bonafide  and the workmen have not approached the court with  clean hands and have suppressed the material facts;
 (d) The claim is not maintainable as there was no  industrial dispute between the workmen and the  management;
ID No. 9271/16 Page No. 6 of 32  (e) Claim is not maintainable as the management is not  industry.
